= League for Social Reconstruction

The League for Social Reconstruction, LSR, is a think tank of Socialist academics from Ottawa. They primarily produce materials aimed towards Socialist education and provide policy-proposals to the National CCF.


- @lsr_papers: Call on the LSR to distribute educational pamphlets
- @root: Return to main


@lsr_papers
title: LSR Papers
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: judiciary


@constitutional_reform_
title: Constitutional Reform
subtitle: Pursue reforms of the inadequate Weimar Constitution.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and ccf_in_government and justice_minister_party = ccf_name and ((in_lps_coalition) or (in_ccf_majority) or (in_left_front) or (in_unity_government)) and judicial_reform >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not ccf_in_government : The [+ ccf_name +] is not currently in government. ?] [? if justice_minister_party != ccf_name : We do not have the Justice Ministry. ?] [? if judicial_reform < 2: The judiciary is unlikely to tolerate progressive constitutional changes. ?] [? if not ((in_lps_coalition) or (in_ccf_majority) or (in_left_front) or (in_unity_government)) : Our current governing coalition will not support constitutional reforms. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; constitutional_reform_timer -= 12
go-to: constitutional_reform

